<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Light 1996 net 173.2 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Light 1996 net 173.2 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian power utility company Light issued the following statement on its 1996 results.</p>
<p>			 1996		     1995</p>
<p>    net profit     173.2 million	   N/A</p>
<p>    dividend	 8.9051 reais	    N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais. Dividend figures provided per 1,000 shares. No comparative and revenue data was avaliable.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said tax on profits obtained previous to 1996 will represent a discount of 0.1079 real per 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>More informationa avaliable at Internet address:</p>
<p>www.lightrio.com.br</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 2485415))</p>
